silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_visible_atoms_concrete_anchor#sectionfile silm:hasLongDescription "The SectionFile is the TaskNode that records the admitted body-mass measurement as the engine's executable transformation. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{SectionFile}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
